  "definition": "Involuntary Admission of Adults to NHH",
  "effectiveDate": "2016-09-20",
  "historyNote": "#4838, eff 6-15-90, EXPIRED: 6-15-96 New. #7050, eff 6-29-99, EXPIRED: 6-29-07 New. #9191, eff 6-26-08; ss by #11183, eff 9-20-16",
